		"The base of noodles, dumplings, and bread."
	]
	quest.2C3F5B7D8E9A1034.title: "Wheat Dough"
	quest.2C3F5B7D8E9A1035.quest_desc: [
		"Dough wrapped around onion and cabbage. Boiled in the pot, not fried."
		""
		"High saturation per bite, stacks to 32, easy to automate once the dough chain is running. A common workhorse meal for long builds."
